{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14250","headline":"花发上林 · 窦常","name":"花发上林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上苑晓沈沈，花枝乱缀阴。\n色浮双阙近，春入九门深。\n向暖风初扇，余寒雪尚侵。\n艳回秦女目，愁处越人心。\n绕绕时萦蝶，关关乍引禽。\n宁知幽谷羽，一举欲依林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}